    "contrast_with_ace2": "ACE2-SOM (coarse 1deg) came back ~causal after bug fixes; FourCastNet's global 2D-FFT mixing yields an instantaneous global receptive field that ERA5-scale physical signals cannot.",
    "honest_caveats": [
      "Out-of-cone ENERGY fraction is modest (~4% beyond 300m/s, ~9% beyond 100m/s) because response energy concentrates near the source; the acausal signature is in the REACH (global in 1 step), not the bulk energy.",
      "u100m/v100m proxied by 1000hPa winds and RH derived from q,T,p; these are base-state approximations and do not create the global reach (it is the AFNO FFT).",
